<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - InPhyNet cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it lowered its recommendation on InPhyNet Medical Management Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- InPhyNet shares were up 3-1/4 to 26 following news that the company had agreed to merge with MedPartners Inc in a $493 million stock swap. The deal values InPhyNet at about $26.38 per share.</p>
<p>-- MedPartner shares were off 1-3/4 to 20-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
